# 006 Energize / Wake-Up — beta up-ramp, ~18:00. AUDIO carries the 10->20 Hz beat.
# Goal: morning wake-up / pre-task energiser; groggy -> alert in ~18 min.
# Bands: beta, ramp 10 -> 18-20 Hz (hold 18-20), gentle ease to 16 at the end.
#
# SAFETY (guidelines section 4): NEVER bright full-field flicker 15-25 Hz.
#   - The 10->20 Hz climb is carried ENTIRELY by AUDIO isochronic `modulation` on ch1.
#   - LED flickers only at 10 Hz (alpha, <12 Hz) and DIM (<=25%) during induction.
#   - The instant the beat would cross ~12 Hz (t=3:00) the LED goes STEADY (freq 0);
#     thereafter only its brightness rises. No LED flicker ever in the 15-25 Hz band.
#   - Light ramps in/out >=10 s; first-flicker brightness <=25%; high brightness is
#     STEADY (non-flickering) light only. Cool white (200,220,255). Audio vol <=65.
#   - Ends ALERT: lamp stays bright, audio stays on (NO fade to 0).
#
# Channels: Audio ch1 = isochronic driver, 420 Hz sine carrier, centred.
#           LED mask 15 = full visible frame, cool white.
# Format:  LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask  |  Audio: A time freq pan vol mod channel

# ---- Induction (10 Hz alpha flicker, dim; vol fade-in) ----
0      10 40 >0 200 220 255 5    # LED gentle 10 Hz flicker (alpha, safe), brightness fade-in start
12000  10 40 25 200 220 255 5    # brightness reaches 25% (12 s ramp-in, >=10 s)
A 0      420 0 >0 10 1            # ch1 isochronic: 420 Hz carrier, vol fade-in start, beat 10 Hz
S 3000 default 65 "Starting at ten hertz, in alpha. Take a breath and let's begin to wake up."
A 40000  420 0 55 10 1           # t=0:40 vol fade-in complete (0->55 over 40 s), beat steady 10 Hz

# ---- Deepening (flicker OFF -> STEADY; beat climbs 10->18 via AUDIO) ----
180000 0 100 >25 200 220 255 5   # t=3:00 flicker OFF -> STEADY (freq 0); brightness ramp 25->70 start
A 180000 420 0 55 >10 1          # t=3:00 beat ramp START 10 Hz -> (target 18 at t=10:00), ~1.1 Hz/min
S 180000 default 65 "Climbing now, rising up through the bands toward beta. Feel your energy building."

# ---- Hold (beta 18-20 Hz, audio-only; bright steady cool white) ----
600000 0 100 >70 200 220 255 5   # t=10:00 steady reaches 70%; brightness ramp 70->80 start
A 600000 420 0 65 18 1           # t=10:00 beat = 18 Hz (beta hold begins, audio-carried)
S 600000 default 65 "You have reached beta, eighteen hertz. Alert and awake, fully switched on."
840000 0 100 80 200 220 255 5    # t=14:00 brightness peaks 80% (steady)
A 840000 420 0 65 >18 1          # t=14:00 beat ramp START 18 -> (target 20 at t=16:00)
A 960000 420 0 65 20 1           # t=16:00 beat = 20 Hz plateau
S 960000 default 65 "Peak energy now at twenty hertz. Bright, sharp, and ready."

# ---- Exit (gentle ease to 16 Hz; stays alert) ----
A 990000 420 0 65 >20 1          # t=16:30 beat ramp START 20 -> (target 16 at t=18:00)

# ---- End: ALERT (no fade to 0) ----
1080000 0 100 80 200 220 255 5   # t=18:00 lamp stays ON, bright steady cool white
A 1080000 420 0 60 16 1          # t=18:00 ends ON, beat parked at 16 Hz (low-beta, alert)
S 1080000 default 65 "Settling to sixteen hertz, awake and alert. Go take on your day."
